{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"柬埔寨","country_iso":"KHM","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:42:15.096654","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"KHM-HB-0003","ldc":"Yes","location":"金边市","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"柬埔寨金边充电桩工程EPC总承包项目","project_name_en":"Cambodia Phnom Penh EV Charging Station EPC Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中水电","content":"近日，中水电柬埔寨分公司收到业主通知，成功中标柬埔寨充电桩工程EPC总承包项目（以下简称“项目”）。\n该项目位于柬埔寨首都金边市，计划工期为36个日历月，项目实施内容涵盖约100个充电桩站的设计与施工，以及400台套充电桩设备的采购和安装。项目将分阶段布局柬埔寨全国范围，助力柬埔寨运营充电站总量扩充，为柬埔寨新能源汽车产业发展与绿色交通体系建设提供有力保障。\n该项目作为柬埔寨分公司在柬中标的首个新能源领域充电桩EPC项目，是积极推动绿色能源发展的重要实践，也为进一步开拓当地新能源市场奠定了坚实基础。","content_sha256":"982727b08a3280189ca6b6a118d5165619daa9777926898988f715907c267a69","id":1591,"publish_date":"2025-10-16 13:47:13","title":"中水电柬埔寨分公司中标柬埔寨充电桩工程EPC总承包项目","title_sha256":"4c1ee2f9f901444d502e4bc2c62d4eab6fb207f9f8aea924ef5d23a1ab9a65c0","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/88721.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"KHM-HB-0003","capacity_details":"约100个充电桩站，400台套充电桩设备","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:42:15.096714","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"KHM-HB-0003-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.cwe.cn/xwzx/jydt/202510/t20251028_277295.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"中国水电柬埔寨分公司中标柬埔寨充电桩工程EPC总承包项目，该项目位于金边市，将建设约100个充电桩站和安装400台套充电桩设备，旨在支持柬埔寨新能源汽车产业发展。","publish_date":"2025-10-16 13:47:13","pv_cap